<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Itron revised to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Itron revised to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it has revised its opinion on Itron to hold due to the ongoing uncertainties associated with completing the company's fixed network agenda.</p>
<p>-- The company's expected Q3 loss, high fixed network devlopment costs drive sharply reduced '96 and '97 outlook.</p>
</text>
